stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "pending" as pending
    state "paid" as paid
    state "succeeded (legacy/mock)" as succeeded
    state "failed" as failed
    state "cancelled" as cancelled
    state "expired" as expired
    state "paid_review" as paid_review

    [*] --> pending: create VNPay checkout [server price and unique reference] / store expiry
    [*] --> succeeded: mock or staff purchase [confirmed locally] / invoice and membership
    pending --> paid: verified IPN [signature, merchant, amount, success] / fulfill product and invoice
    pending --> failed: verified IPN [non-success and response != 24] / audit failure
    pending --> cancelled: verified IPN [response = 24] / audit cancellation
    pending --> expired: status read or Celery expiry [expires_at <= now] / audit expiry
    pending --> paid_review: verified class success [hold cannot be fulfilled] / require manual refund review
    failed --> paid_review: verified late class success / require manual refund review
    cancelled --> paid_review: verified late class success / require manual refund review
    expired --> paid_review: verified late class success / require manual refund review
    paid --> [*]
    succeeded --> [*]
    paid_review --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    expired --> [*]

    note bottom of pending
        Invalid signature or merchant: RspCode 97, no state change.
        Amount mismatch: RspCode 04, no state change.
        Duplicate terminal callback: RspCode 02, no state change.
    end note
    note bottom of paid_review
        resolved records an internal class-refund resolution only.
        No VNPay reversal or reconciliation API is implemented.
    end note
